  ✗ wildcard_downsampling  face radio  zk2/lab/*/radio.v1/stream/air/dropped_total
against the plan: 4 difference(s)
  ✗ subject_differs       local   planned cns [] usernames ["local"] link_protocols ["tcp", "udp", "tls", "quic", "serial", "unixpipe", "vsock", "ws"]; configured cns [] usernames ["local"]
  ✗ policy_missing        ground  planned rules [call-in:tool.console, call-out:tool.console, consume-in:tool.console, consume-out:tool.console, face:radio:@state, face:radio:@stream:radio.v1, face:radio:admin, face:radio:adv, face:radio:events:radio.v1, face:radio:state:radio.v1, face:radio:stream:radio.v1, face:radio:zk] subjects [ground]
